TEXT -336 -600 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vout AVG V(out)\n.meas TRAN maxVout MAX V(out)\n.meas TRAN minVout MIN V(out)\n.meas TRAN Delta_V_R1 PARAM (maxVout-minVout)/2\n.meas TRAN Iout AVG I(R1)\n.meas TRAN I_L1_avg AVG I(L1)\n.meas TRAN maxL1 MAX I(L1)\n.meas TRAN minL1 MIN I(L1)\n.meas TRAN Delta_I_L1 PARAM (maxL1-minL1)/2\n.meas TRAN Delta_I_L1_percent PARAM(Delta_I_L1 * 100 / I_L1_avg )
TEXT 712 -624 Left 2 !;Real component values, nominal, derated\n;Inductance\n.param L1=68u\n.param L1_R_para 0.265\n.param L1_C_para 5p ;no info, value is guessed, \n;similar values can be found with similar inductors\n \n;Capacitors\n.param C2 47u\n.param C2_R_para 340m\n.param Cin1 22u\n.param Cin2 220n
